{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1db00085bb697c2392199e9afb9b092a573fb1ccef6f6cd5276a6ec00089dc5a", "ja": "（奈緒と一緒に、お兄さんの所属するサッカーチームの\n試合を見に来た。すごく盛り上がる内容だった！）", "zh": "（和奈绪一起来看她哥哥所在的足球队的比赛。比赛内容非常精彩！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "e6c6257b46b6820fe23aff930a781ad7201388ee3483b3cc77cae7e1650f7959", "ja": "いやー、メッチャ感動しました！　あんな大事な場面で\nまさか、アニキがゴールを決めるなんて……。", "zh": "哎呀，真的太感动了！没想到哥哥居然能在那么关键的时刻进球……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1b3af2e59bc6e653918a65bbbabccd74e04eb05c539918a25c577631f5914713", "ja": "そうだな。相手の選手たちを、\nごぼう抜きしてのゴール……！　俺も痺れたよ！", "zh": "是啊。连续突破对方球员，进球得分……！我也看得热血沸腾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "fb33bdd76b618a46fb176f963784c08684e39bbc2540b18dd7528cc508d2f2e4", "ja": "ですよね！　私もう、思わず興奮してもうて……\nしてしも、て……。", "zh": "对吧！我也忍不住激动起来了……\n好像、太激动了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "409b41f637b5bd3d1dd652e8be7572ab5cad4d956e3325c7427867345c28fedc", "ja": "……あの、{$P$}さん。\nさっき、私とんでもないことしちゃってませんでした？", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}先生。\n刚才我是不是做了什么不得了的事啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "e00fe141eb055aeb91ec89e3d1aae09cd8cce85092227354ff8a85c3d85ad40a", "ja": "その、だ、抱き着いたり……。", "zh": "那个，我、我刚才是不是抱、抱住你了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1006_p", "source_sha256": "09fcf1252be68dfa690bee71c6c369f2fe89266d131b461f4f36ea5a2d4848a5", "ja": "あ、ああ……。そんなこともあったな。", "zh": "啊、啊啊……确实也发生过那种事来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "6ade814656cf011b90a0f20990263ed612dc60794778651d383d13dce0c5097b", "ja": "やっぱり、やっちゃってましたよね！？\nうわ～、メッチャ恥ずかしなってきた～！", "zh": "果然还是被您看到了啊！？\n哇～，这也太难为情了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "4d789dfd225b9c0ab8297f70b81e521bae60d09bc806580bcf6a85612e0325ae", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}さん！\nアニキのゴールがうれしすぎて、つい……。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}先生！\n因为大哥进球，实在太开心了，一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1009_p", "source_sha256": "16150c887be59a8cec598540031ee5b1d8e61297f6350990d993f1a334b93ddc", "ja": "いや、別に謝らなくても……。ちょっと驚いたけど、\nあの劇的なゴールなら仕方ないと思う。", "zh": "不，倒也不用道歉啦……虽然稍微吓了一跳，\n但毕竟是那么戏剧性的进球，也是没办法的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "c8e6c9f46ac39be106dfd14d802a48596dcd82ecc41b32535cd5bc1d50ebdf92", "ja": "そうですよね、あははーっ！\nって、受け入れられるんも逆に照れますって！", "zh": "就是说嘛，啊哈哈——！\n不过，能这样接受反倒让我有点不好意思啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6b06cefecc2a5a9b9a5634378a0580ae6ca77031007728437961d5721c42def9", "ja": "えっ？　そういうつもりでもなかったんだけど……。\nうーん……どんな対応だったら奈緒は平気なんだ？", "zh": "诶？我也没那个意思……  \n嗯……怎样的应对奈绪才不会觉得尴尬？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "f7d9ec28932be528a915318b2ccc6f80204c4d8e13b8ab2ccefd210e36d8c68e", "ja": "そりゃー……あれ？\nうっ……それはですね、その～……。", "zh": "那当然是……咦？\n呃……这个嘛，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "782a9b7b80de687b24c1643e8595099adb29abd47f98eb5ec9a2b1f89bdb43a4", "ja": "あかん、思いつきません！\nこの問題、メッチャムズいですわ……。", "zh": "不行，想不出来！\n这道题实在太难了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8cfde957ae4c0001b93e79cbf31ec63b69edb1c4b9d988b8fc61fcce5d001865", "ja": "ははっ、そうだろう？\nひとまず観戦で疲れてるし、難しい話はやめよう。", "zh": "哈哈，我就知道吧？\n先不说这个了，看比赛也累了，别聊太难的话题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "39c616646a596fbf467536d88878cfad94bd86a262b6d3a0ff4d69fe00a4b364", "ja": "ですね。……せや！　帰る前に売店寄っても\nいいですか？　ちょっと欲しいもんがあって。", "zh": "是啊。……对了！回去之前，我可以去趟小卖部吗？有样东西想买。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d34968e6c51ca89db80b3cdc07ec8a88a6df98c71116c40d0c315efba6d75471", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。何を買うつもりなんだ？", "zh": "啊，当然可以。你打算买什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "1b360f5205aeb83596ff563f5151b3251bf10e7002a3c92384383825101acb99", "ja": "それはですね……秘密です！　でも、せっかく\n一緒に来たんで、記念になるもんですかね～。えへへ♪", "zh": "这个嘛……保密！不过，难得一起过来，我想买点能留下纪念的东西吧～。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0404_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "8d1835f6694f509af319536a466f866622a950017e63aaea22caa744f80eed9e", "ja": "{$P$}さんの分も考えてあるんで\n楽しみにしててくださいね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生的那份我也已经想好了，\n敬请期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
